{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">網絡流傳一段車Cam影片，事發地點位於大圍，一名婆婆推着載滿紙皮的手推車，在兩車之間的盲點縫隙中突走出行車道，此時正好有一輛的士駛至，所幸司機反應極快，連忙扭軚兼煞車，最終擦撞到手推車上的紙皮，驚險避過一劫。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-09-12h09m02s003.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KETTb4xNDg1791519817.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-09-12h09m02s003.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-09-12h09m13s172.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PUiEp2E0k51791519825.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-09-12h09m13s172.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">片段引發大批網民圍觀，並就婆婆的過路習慣與司機的駕駛車速展開熱烈討論：</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">·       怒轟亂過馬路派：不少網民直指婆婆過馬路前完全沒有看清情況，留言怒斥：「話出就出，路都唔睇」、「個個大地任我行 」、「遲早出事」。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left\">·       質疑司機車速派：亦有網民抱持不同看法，認為該處兩旁停滿車輛、視野受阻，的士不應開太快，留言指：「呢啲路開咁快，好彩唔係撞到人。」、「兩邊泊晒車都揸咁快。」、「揸啲啲路呢就唔應該揸咁快嘅！今次好彩係撞架車仔啫」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T04:39:08.413158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}